{"clase": "<h4>Casos: no balanceado, prohibidos y máximo</h4>\n<ul><li><b>Más recursos que actividades</b> (o al revés): agrega columnas (o filas) ficticias con 0. El recurso asignado al ficticio queda sin actividad.</li>\n<li><b>Asignación prohibida</b> (\"el operador 1 no puede ir a la máquina 3\"): costo <b>M</b>.</li>\n<li><b>Maximizar</b>: transforma cada valor en (mayor valor de la tabla − c<sub>ij</sub>) y minimiza. También sirve cambiar el signo. Al final suma los valores <b>originales</b>.</li>\n<li><b>Soluciones múltiples</b>: si en la matriz final puedes elegir otra combinación de ceros independientes, hay otra solución óptima con el mismo total.</li></ul>", "ejemplos": [{"q": "<p>Resolver el problema de asignación que <b>maximiza</b> los beneficios (apunte \"Un problema de asignación de MÁXIMO\"):</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"ht\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>1</th><th>2</th><th>3</th><th>4</th><th>5</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td>2</td><td>4</td><td>10</td><td>3</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td>7</td><td>7</td><td>5</td><td>6</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td>8</td><td>6</td><td>7</td><td>8</td><td>9</td></tr><tr><th>D</th><td>4</td><td>9</td><td>12</td><td>8</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><th>E</th><td>11</td><td>8</td><td>6</td><td>6</td><td>5</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Encuentre la asignación de beneficio máximo.</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Desarrollo</h5><p><b>Maximizar:</b> se transforma a minimizar con c'<sub>ij</sub> = 12 − c<sub>ij</sub> (el mayor valor de la tabla menos cada valor). Las celdas prohibidas siguen con M.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"ht\"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"\">1</th><th class=\"\">2</th><th class=\"\">3</th><th class=\"\">4</th><th class=\"\">5</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th class=\"\">A</th><td class=\"\">10</td><td class=\"\">8</td><td class=\"\">2</td><td class=\"\">9</td><td class=\"\">6</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">B</th><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"\">7</td><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"\">8</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">C</th><td class=\"\">4</td><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"\">4</td><td class=\"\">3</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">D</th><td class=\"\">8</td><td class=\"\">3</td><td class=\"z\">0</td><td class=\"\">4</td><td class=\"\">5</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">E</th><td class=\"\">1</td><td class=\"\">4</td><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"\">7</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Paso 1a:</b> a cada fila se le resta su menor valor (entre paréntesis):</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"ht\"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"\">1</th><th class=\"\">2</th><th class=\"\">3</th><th class=\"\">4</th><th class=\"\">5</th><th class=\"pen\">mín</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th class=\"\">A</th><td class=\"\">10</td><td class=\"\">8</td><td class=\"\">2</td><td class=\"\">9</td><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"pen\">(2)</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">B</th><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"\">7</td><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"\">8</td><td class=\"pen\">(5)</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">C</th><td class=\"\">4</td><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"\">4</td><td class=\"\">3</td><td class=\"pen\">(3)</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">D</th><td class=\"\">8</td><td class=\"\">3</td><td class=\"z\">0</td><td class=\"\">4</td><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"pen\">(0)</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">E</th><td class=\"\">1</td><td class=\"\">4</td><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"\">7</td><td class=\"pen\">(1)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Paso 1b:</b> a cada columna se le resta su menor valor:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"ht\"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"\">1</th><th class=\"\">2</th><th class=\"\">3</th><th class=\"\">4</th><th class=\"\">5</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th class=\"\">A</th><td class=\"\">8</td><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"z\">0</td><td class=\"\">7</td><td c