dos):</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"ht\"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"\">1</th><th class=\"\">2</th><th class=\"\">3</th><th class=\"\">4</th><th class=\"\">5</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th class=\"cov\">A</th><td class=\"cr\">5</td><td class=\"cr\">3</td><td class=\"cr star z\">0</td><td class=\"cr\">3</td><td class=\"cr\">1</td></tr><tr><th class=\"cov\">B</th><td class=\"cr z\">0</td><td class=\"cr star z\">0</td><td class=\"cr\">5</td><td class=\"cr z\">0</td><td class=\"cr\">3</td></tr><tr><th class=\"cov\">C</th><td class=\"cr\">1</td><td class=\"cr\">3</td><td class=\"cr\">5</td><td class=\"cr z\">0</td><td class=\"cr star z\">0</td></tr><tr><th class=\"cov\">D</th><td class=\"cr\">5</td><td class=\"cr z\">0</td><td class=\"cr z\">0</td><td class=\"cr star z\">0</td><td class=\"cr\">2</td></tr><tr><th class=\"cov\">E</th><td class=\"cr star z\">0</td><td class=\"cr\">3</td><td class=\"cr\">8</td><td class=\"cr\">4</td><td class=\"cr\">6</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Solución:</b> A → 3 (10); B → 2 (7); C → 5 (9); D → 4 (8); E → 1 (11). <b>Beneficio total = 45</b>.</p><p><b>Soluciones múltiples:</b> hay más de una asignación sobre los ceros, por ejemplo: A → 3; B → 4; C → 5; D → 2; E → 1 (total = 45).</p></div>", "intro": "El profesor transforma con 12 − c<sub>ij</sub> y obtiene un total de 45."}, {"q": "<p>Asignar cuatro operadores a cuatro máquinas. El operador 1 no puede ir a la máquina 3 y el operador 3 no puede ir a la máquina 4:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"ht\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Máq1</th><th>Máq2</th><th>Máq3</th><th>Máq4</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Op1</th><td>5</td><td>5</td><td>–</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Op2</th><td>7</td><td>4</td><td>2</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Op3</th><td>9</td><td>3</td><td>5</td><td>–</td></tr><tr><th>Op4</th><td>7</td><td>2</td><td>6</td><td>7</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"src\">C2 2026-1, Problema 4 a).</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Encuentre la asignación óptima.</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Desarrollo</h5><p>Las asignaciones prohibidas se reemplazan por M.</p><p><b>Paso 1a:</b> a cada fila se le resta su menor valor (entre paréntesis):</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"ht\"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"\">Máq1</th><th class=\"\">Máq2</th><th class=\"\">Máq3</th><th class=\"\">Máq4</th><th class=\"pen\">mín</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th class=\"\">Op1</th><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"\">M</td><td class=\"\">2</td><td class=\"pen\">(2)</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">Op2</th><td class=\"\">7</td><td class=\"\">4</td><td class=\"\">2</td><td class=\"\">3</td><td class=\"pen\">(2)</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">Op3</th><td class=\"\">9</td><td class=\"\">3</td><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"\">M</td><td class=\"pen\">(3)</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">Op4</th><td class=\"\">7</td><td class=\"\">2</td><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"\">7</td><td class=\"pen\">(2)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Paso 1b:</b> a cada columna se le resta su menor valor:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"ht\"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"\">Máq1</th><th class=\"\">Máq2</th><th class=\"\">Máq3</th><th class=\"\">Máq4</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th class=\"\">Op1</th><td class=\"\">3</td><td class=\"\">3</td><td class=\"\">M−2</td><td class=\"z\">0</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">Op2</th><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"\">2</td><td class=\"z\">0</td><td class=\"\">1</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">Op3</th><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"z\">0</td><td class=\"\">2</td><td class=\"\">M−3</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">Op4</th><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"z\">0</td><td class=\"\">4</td><td class=\"\">5</td></tr><tr><th class=\"pen\">mín</th><td class=\"pen\">(3)</td><td class=\"pen\">(0)</td><td class=\"pen\">(0)</td><td class=\"pen\">(0)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Paso 2:</b> mínimo de líneas = 3 &lt; 4. <b>Paso 3:</b> menor valor no cubierto k = 2: se resta a los no cubiertos y se suma a las intersecciones.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"ht\"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"\">Máq1</th><th class=\"cov\">Máq2</th><th class=\"\">Máq3</th><th class=\"\">Máq4</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th class=\"cov\">Op1</th><td class=\"cr z\">0</td><td class=\"cr cc2 x2\">3</td><td class=\"cr\">M−2</td><td class=\"cr z\">0</td></tr><tr><th class=\"cov\">Op2</th><td class=\"cr\">2</td><td class=\"cr cc2 x2\">2</td><td class=\"cr z\">0</td><td class=\"cr\">1</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">Op3</th><td class=\"\">3</td><td class=\"cc2 z\">0</td><td class=\"\">2</td><td class=\"\">M−3</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">Op4</th><td class=\"\">2</td><td class=\"cc2 z\">0</td><td class=\"\">4</td><td class=\"\">5</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Paso 2:</b> se necesitan 4 líneas para cubrir todos los ceros = n = 4 ⇒ <b>óptimo</b>. Asignación sobre los ceros (marcados):</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"ht\"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"\">Máq1</th><th class=\"\">Máq2</th><th class=\"\">Máq3</th><th class=\"\">Máq4</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th class=\"cov\">Op1</th><td class=\"cr z\">0</td><td class=\"cr\">5</td><td class=\"cr\">M−2</td><td class=\"cr star z\">0</td></tr><tr><th class=\"cov\">Op2</th><td class=\"cr\">2</td><td class=\"cr\">4</td><td class=\"cr star z\">0</td><td class=\"cr\">1</td></tr><tr><th class=\"cov\">Op3</th><td class=\"cr\">1</td><td class=\"cr star z\">0</td><td class=\"cr z\">0</td><td class=\"cr\">M−5</td></tr><tr><th class=\"cov\">Op4</th><td class=\"cr star z\">0</td><td class=\"cr z\">0</td><td class=\"cr\">2</td><td class=\"cr\">3</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Solución:</b> Op1 → Máq4 (2); Op2 → Máq3 (2); Op3 → Máq2 (3); Op4 → Máq1 (7). <b>Costo total = 14</b>.</p></div>", "intro": "Problema 4 a) del último C2: la pauta obtiene costo total 14."}], "ejercicios": [{"q": "<p>Una compañía compró 3 máquinas nuevas y hay 4 sitios para instalarlas. Costo de manejo de materiales por unidad de tiempo; el sitio 2 no es adecuado para la máquina 2:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"ht\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Sitio1</th><th>Sitio2</th><th>Sitio3</th><th>Sitio4</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Máq1</th><td>13</td><td>16</td><td>11</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><th>Máq2</th><td>15</td><td>–</td><td>13</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><th>Máq3</th><td>5</td><td>7</td><td>10</td><td>6</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"src\">Ejemplo 2 del apunte de asignación.</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Construya la tabla de asignación balanceada.</li><li><b>b)</b> Encuentre la asignación óptima.</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Desarrollo</h5><p><b>Paso 0 (balancear):</b> hay 3 filas y 4 columnas ⇒ se agrega 1 fila ficticia con costo 0.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"ht\"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"\">Sitio1</th><th class=\"\">Sitio2</th><th class=\"\">Sitio3</th><th class=\"\">Sitio4</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th class=\"\">Máq1</th><td class=\"\">13</td><td class=\"\">16</td><td class=\"\">11</td><td class=\"\">12</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">Máq2</th><td class=\"\">15</td><td class=\"\">M</td><td class=\"\">13</td><td class=\"\">20</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">Máq3</th><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"\">7</td><td class=\"\">10</td><td class=\"\">6</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">Fic</th><td class=\"z\">0</td><td class=\"z\">0</td><td class=\"z\">0</td><td class=\"z\">0</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Paso 1a:</b> a cada fila se le resta su menor valor (entre paréntesis):</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"ht\"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"\">Sitio1</th><th class=\"\">Sitio2</th><th class=\"\">Sitio3</th><th class=\"\">Sitio4</th><th class=\"pen\">mín</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th class=\"\">Máq1</th><td class=\"\">13</td><td class=\"\">16</td><td class=\"\">11</td><td class=\"\">12</td><td class=\"pen\">(11)</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">Máq2</th><td class=\"\">15</td><td class=\"\">M</td><td class=\"\">13</td><td class=\"\">20</td><td class=\"pen\">(13)</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">Máq3</th><td class=\